/**
 * FILE: ProcessPush.gs
 * LAYER: API Dispatch + App Entry Points
 * PURPOSE: doGet/onOpen entry points, SendGrid API dispatch, StatusCast API dispatch.
 *
 * PHASE 1 FIXES APPLIED:
 *   P1-01 | CONFIG block no longer calls PropertiesService at module load time.
 *          | Replaced with the same lazy-load pattern as Config.gs.
 *          | All spreadsheet access now routes through getSpreadsheetId().
 *   P1-02 | All template literals (backticks) removed throughout this file.
 *          | All string assembly uses explicit "+" concatenation.
 *   P1-03 | Hardcoded StatusCast admin email promoted to Script Property
 *          | "StatusCastAssignedEmail". Falls back gracefully if not set.
 *   P1-04 | Duplicate functions removed: calculateTimezones(), 
 *          | generateMasterHtmlLayout(), fetchPodDataFromSheet(),
 *          | getSpreadsheetTemplatesConfig() are deleted from this file.
 *          | All calls now resolve to the canonical copies in their own files.
 *   P1-05 | processTrustPushRequest no longer calls fetchPodDataFromSheet()
 *          | internally. The client now passes podMetadata in the payload,
 *          | eliminating the redundant Sheets read on every Trust submission.
 *   P1-16 | debugMaintenanceRow() moved to the bottom of this file under a
 *          | clear DEV UTILITIES section header so it is easy to find and
 *          | remove before a production deployment freeze.
 *
 * DEPENDENCIES (resolved automatically by GAS project scope):
 *   Config.gs        -> getSpreadsheetId(), CONFIG
 *   DataAccess.gs    -> fetchPodDataFromSheet() [used only by processTrustPushRequest fallback]
 *   TimeUtil.gs      -> calculateTimezones()
 *   EmailRenderer.gs -> generateMasterHtmlLayout()
 */


